# Build output, committed on purpose.
#
# The site is a static upload to shared hosting: there is no pipeline that
# builds web/src/ on deploy, so the bundles have to exist in the checkout.
# They are generated by esbuild (see web/README.md) and by
# scripts/i18n-merge.mjs — never edited by hand.
#
# linguist-generated collapses them in pull-request diffs and keeps them out
# of GitHub's language statistics, so what shows up as reviewable code is the
# source under web/src/.

web/app.js         linguist-generated=true
web/blog.js        linguist-generated=true
web/demo.js        linguist-generated=true
web/donate.js      linguist-generated=true
web/explorer.js    linguist-generated=true
web/i18n.js        linguist-generated=true
web/i18n.stamp.json linguist-generated=true

# web/i18n.patch.json is NOT listed here: it is the hand-edited input that
# i18n-merge.mjs reads, and its diffs are the ones worth reading.
